@* Calendar UI. Every Backlog.* import is written as @@using global::Backlog.Something,
   for the reason the Events UI's imports give: this project's root namespace is
   Backlog.Modules.Calendar.UI, and a bare "Backlog" inside it would bind to
   Backlog.Modules. Backlog.UI.Components.Tasks stays for CalendarHours, the hours
   wording the grid shares with the Tasks detail panel. *@
